      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2001 John Wiley & Sons, Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "Vernonioside B2 isolated from the methanol extract of the Brazilian herb Vernonia condensata Baker was evaluated in vivo for analgesic and antiinflammatory activities. The compound reduced writhings (93.28%) and Evans blue dye diffusion (91.80%) induced by acetic acid (0.1 N) in a dose-dependent manner."
